
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>HBS · Growing Sales &amp; Revenue</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --navy:#0B1E2B;
    --blue-dark:#1B4965;
    --blue:#2A64A7;
    --teal:#0EA5E9;
    --gold:#FFC107;
    --gold-dark:#E6A800;
    --gold-deep:#92640A;
    --offwhite:#F8FAFC;
    --slate-100:#F1F5F9;
    --ink:#334155;
    --mute:#64748B;
    --card:#FFFFFF;
    --line:#E2E8F0;
    --white:#FFFFFF;
    --grad:linear-gradient(135deg,#0B1E2B 0%,#1B4965 55%,#2A64A7 100%);
    --display:"Lora",Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
    --body:"Poppins",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
    --shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(11,30,43,.08);
    --shadow-sm:0 8px 22px rgba(11,30,43,.06);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{font-family:var(--body);color:var(--ink);background:var(--white);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;line-height:1.6;}

  /* scroller */
  .deck{height:100vh;overflow-y:scroll;scroll-snap-type:y mandatory;scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  .deck:focus{outline:none}
  .slide{min-height:100vh;scroll-snap-align:start;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:clamp(2rem,5vw,5.5rem) clamp(1.5rem,6vw,7rem);position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
  .inner{width:100%;max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;z-index:1}

  /* theming */
  .slide--dark{background:var(--grad);color:var(--white)}
  .slide--dark::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 78% 32%,rgba(255,193,7,.10) 0%,transparent 55%);pointer-events:none}
  .slide--light{background:var(--white)}
  .slide--alt{background:var(--slate-100)}

  /* type */
  .eyebrow{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--body);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(.66rem,1vw,.76rem);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-deep);background:rgba(255,193,7,.15);padding:.4rem .95rem;border-radius:50px;margin-bottom:1.2rem;}
  .slide--dark .eyebrow{color:var(--gold);background:rgba(255,193,7,.16)}
  h1{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(2.6rem,7vw,5rem);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--white);}
  h1 span{color:#7DD3FC}
  h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4.4vw,3rem);line-height:1.12;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1.4rem;}
  .lede{font-size:clamp(1.02rem,1.5vw,1.26rem);max-width:60ch;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.7}
  .lede b{color:var(--blue-dark)}
  .sub{font-size:clamp(1rem,1.4vw,1.18rem);color:var(--mute);max-width:64ch;margin-bottom:2rem;line-height:1.65}
  .title-sub{font-family:var(--display);font-style:italic;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2vw,1.55rem);color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);margin-top:1.4rem;max-width:54ch;}
  .foot{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--mute);margin-top:2.2rem;}
  .slide--dark .foot{color:rgba(255,255,255,.8)}

  /* icon tiles */
  .ic{width:clamp(2.9rem,4vw,3.5rem);height:clamp(2.9rem,4vw,3.5rem);border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:0 0 auto;}
  .ic svg{width:52%;height:52%;stroke-width:2;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
  .ic--navy{background:rgba(42,100,167,.10)}
  .ic--navy svg{stroke:var(--blue)}
  .ic--navy svg.fill{fill:var(--blue);stroke:none}
  .ic--cherry{background:rgba(255,193,7,.18)}
  .ic--cherry svg{stroke:var(--gold-deep)}
  .ic--cherry svg.fill{fill:var(--gold-deep);stroke:none}
  .ic--deep{background:rgba(11,30,43,.08)}
  .ic--deep svg{stroke:var(--navy)}

  /* card grids */
  .grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:clamp(1rem,1.8vw,1.5rem);margin-top:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.6rem)}
  .grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:clamp(1rem,1.8vw,1.5rem);margin-top:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem)}
  .card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(1.3rem,2vw,1.8rem);box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
  .card h3{font-family:var(--body);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.1rem,1.6vw,1.32rem);color:var(--blue-dark);margin:1rem 0 .55rem;line-height:1.2;}
  .card p{font-size:clamp(.9rem,1.15vw,1rem);color:var(--mute);line-height:1.6}
  .card--diag h3{color:var(--navy)}

  /* phase cards */
  .phase{position:relative}
  .phase .card{min-height:100%}
  .phase-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(1.4rem,2vw,1.9rem);box-shadow:var(--shadow);height:100%;}
  .phase-card--hot{background:var(--grad);border:none;color:var(--white);box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(11,30,43,.28)}
  .num{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(3rem,5vw,4.3rem);line-height:.9;color:var(--blue);}
  .phase-card--hot .num{color:var(--gold)}
  .when{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--blue);margin:.9rem 0 .35rem;}
  .phase-card--hot .when{color:var(--gold)}
  .phase-card h3{font-family:var(--body);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.1rem,1.6vw,1.32rem);line-height:1.18;margin-bottom:.5rem;color:var(--navy);}
  .phase-card--hot h3{color:var(--white)}
  .phase-card p{font-size:clamp(.9rem,1.1vw,1rem);color:var(--mute)}
  .phase-card--hot p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.85)}

  /* rows */
  .rows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:clamp(.8rem,1.4vw,1.1rem);margin-top:clamp(1.4rem,2.6vw,2.2rem)}
  .row{display:flex;gap:clamp(1rem,1.6vw,1.5rem);align-items:flex-start;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:clamp(1.1rem,1.7vw,1.5rem) clamp(1.2rem,1.8vw,1.7rem);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);}
  .row .rc h3{font-family:var(--body);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.08rem,1.5vw,1.3rem);color:var(--blue-dark);margin-bottom:.3rem}
  .row .rc p{font-size:clamp(.9rem,1.1vw,1rem);color:var(--mute);line-height:1.6}

  /* feature cards */
  .feat{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(1.4rem,2vw,2rem);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .feat-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .badge{display:inline-block;padding:.32rem .9rem;border-radius:999px;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--white);}
  .badge--now{background:var(--blue)}
  .badge--q4{background:var(--navy)}
  .feat h3{font-family:var(--body);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.2rem,1.8vw,1.5rem);color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.5rem}
  .feat p{font-size:clamp(.9rem,1.15vw,1rem);color:var(--mute);line-height:1.6}

  /* strip */
  .strip{margin-top:clamp(1.1rem,2vw,1.6rem);background:var(--grad);color:var(--white);border-radius:14px;padding:clamp(1.1rem,1.8vw,1.5rem) clamp(1.3rem,2vw,1.8rem);font-size:clamp(.95rem,1.25vw,1.1rem);line-height:1.55;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(11,30,43,.2)}
  .strip b{color:var(--gold)}
  .strip span{color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)}

  /* gate (unused) */
  .gate{margin-top:clamp(1.2rem,2vw,1.7rem);background:var(--slate-100);border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:14px;padding:clamp(1.1rem,1.8vw,1.5rem) clamp(1.3rem,2vw,1.8rem);font-size:clamp(.92rem,1.15vw,1.05rem);color:var(--ink);}
  .gate b{color:var(--gold-deep)}

  /* comparison table */
  .cmp{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1fr 1fr;gap:.5rem .75rem;margin-top:clamp(1.3rem,2.4vw,1.9rem)}
  .cmp .hcell{border-radius:12px;padding:.85rem 1.05rem}
  .cmp .hcell .lab{font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:clamp(.95rem,1.3vw,1.15rem)}
  .cmp .hcell .tag{font-size:.74rem;font-style:italic;margin-top:.15rem}
  .cmp .h-boost{background:var(--slate-100);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--navy)}
  .cmp .h-boost .tag{color:var(--mute)}
  .cmp .h-ads{background:var(--grad);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(11,30,43,.22)}
  .cmp .h-ads .tag{color:var(--gold)}
  .cmp .dim{display:flex;align-items:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--blue-dark);font-size:clamp(.86rem,1.1vw,1rem)}
  .cmp .cell{border-radius:10px;padding:.65rem .95rem;font-size:clamp(.86rem,1.05vw,1rem);display:flex;align-items:center;line-height:1.3}
  .cmp .cell.boost{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink)}
  .cmp .cell.ads{background:rgba(255,193,7,.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,193,7,.5);color:var(--navy);font-weight:600}

  /* not-doing columns (unused) */
  .two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.6rem);margin-top:clamp(1.4rem,2.6vw,2rem)}
  .col{border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2rem);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .col--soft{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .col--hard{background:var(--grad);color:var(--white)}
  .col .k{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.76rem;color:var(--blue)}
  .col--hard .k{color:var(--gold)}
  .col .note{font-style:italic;color:var(--mute);font-size:.92rem;margin:.3rem 0 1.1rem}
  .col--hard .note{color:rgba(255,255,255,.85)}
  .col ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.7rem}
  .col li{position:relative;padding-left:1.3rem;font-size:clamp(1rem,1.3vw,1.15rem)}
  .col li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:.55em;width:.5rem;height:.5rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold)}
  .col .why{font-style:italic;color:var(--mute);font-size:.92rem;margin-top:1.4rem}
  .hard-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.9rem;margin-bottom:.4rem}
  .hard-title{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.15rem,1.7vw,1.5rem);color:var(--white);margin:.9rem 0 .7rem}
  .col--hard p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);font-size:clamp(.92rem,1.15vw,1.03rem)}

  /* timeline */
  .track{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:clamp(.8rem,1.4vw,1.2rem);margin-top:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem)}
  .stage .head{border-radius:12px;padding:.7rem;text-align:center;color:var(--white);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:clamp(.78rem,1vw,.95rem)}
  .stage .body{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;margin-top:.6rem;padding:clamp(1rem,1.6vw,1.4rem);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);min-height:9.5rem}
  .stage ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.6rem}
  .stage li{position:relative;padding-left:1.15rem;font-size:clamp(.9rem,1.1vw,1.02rem);color:var(--ink)}
  .stage li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:.5em;width:.42rem;height:.42rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold)}
  .track-note{text-align:center;font-style:italic;color:var(--mute);margin-top:1.6rem;font-size:.95rem}

  /* close chips */
  .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.9rem;margin-top:1rem}
  .chip{background:var(--gold);color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;padding:.7rem 1.6rem;border-radius:999px;font-size:clamp(.95rem,1.2vw,1.1rem);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(255,193,7,.35);border-bottom:3px solid var(--gold-dark)}
  .close-h{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(2.1rem,5vw,3.7rem);line-height:1.08;color:var(--white);}

  /* signature line */
  .wm{position:absolute;right:-2%;bottom:-4%;width:min(46vw,620px);opacity:.16;pointer-events:none;z-index:0}
  .wm svg{width:100%;height:auto;stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:2.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
  .draw path,.draw polyline{stroke-dasharray:1400;stroke-dashoffset:1400;animation:draw 1.8s ease .3s forwards}
  @keyframes draw{to{stroke-dashoffset:0}}

  /* fixed UI */
  .progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:3px;background:var(--gold);width:0;z-index:40;transition:width .15s ease}
  .counter{position:fixed;top:1.3rem;right:1.6rem;z-index:40;font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--mute);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
  .counter .now{color:var(--gold-dark)}
  .dots{position:fixed;right:1.4rem;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:40;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.6rem}
  .dots button{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;border:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;background:var(--line);transition:all .2s ease;}
  .dots button.on{background:var(--gold);transform:scale(1.5)}
  .hint{position:absolute;bottom:1.8rem;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.1em;opacity:.85;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;z-index:1}
  .hint .arrow{color:var(--gold);animation:bob 1.6s ease-in-out infinite}
  @keyframes bob{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(4px)}}

  /* reveal */
  html.js .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .6s ease,transform .6s ease}
  html.js .slide.active .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;transition-delay:calc(var(--i,0) * 90ms)}

  /* responsive */
  @media (max-width:820px){
    .deck{scroll-snap-type:none}
    .slide{justify-content:flex-start;overflow:visible;padding-top:4.5rem;padding-bottom:3.5rem}
    .grid-3,.grid-2,.two,.track{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .stage .body{min-height:0}
    .dots{display:none}
    .wm{display:none}
    .row{flex-direction:row}
    .counter{top:1rem;right:1rem}
    .cmp{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.3rem}
    .cmp .hcell{display:none}
    .cmp .dim{margin-top:.8rem;color:var(--blue-dark);font-size:1.02rem}
    .cmp .cell{display:block}
    .cmp .cell.boost::before{content:"Boost — ";font-weight:700;color:var(--mute)}
    .cmp .cell.ads::before{content:"Ads Manager — ";font-weight:700;color:var(--gold-deep)}
  }
  @media (max-width:560px){
    .row{flex-direction:column}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none}
    .draw path,.draw polyline{animation:none;stroke-dashoffset:0}
    .hint .arrow{animation:none}
    html,.deck{scroll-behavior:auto}
  }

  /* print */
  @media print{
    .deck{height:auto;overflow:visible}
    .slide{min-height:auto;page-break-after:always;padding:2rem}
    .progress,.counter,.dots,.hint{display:none}
    .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}
    .slide--dark{-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact}
  }

</style>
</head>
<body>
<script>document.documentElement.className="js";</script>

<div class="progress" id="bar"></div>
<div class="counter"><span class="now" id="cnow">01</span> — <span id="ctot">10</span></div>
<div class="dots" id="dots"></div>

<div class="deck" id="deck" tabindex="0">

  <!-- 1 · TITLE -->
  <section class="slide slide--dark" id="s1">
    <div class="wm draw">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 240 240"><polyline points="20 150 60 110 100 130 150 70 190 90 220 40"/><polyline points="180 40 220 40 220 80"/></svg>
    </div>
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal" style="--i:0">Hearing Benefit Services</p>
      <h1 class="reveal" style="--i:1">Growing Sales<br>&amp; Revenue</h1>
      <p class="title-sub reveal" style="--i:2">A focused plan to convert more of the demand we already have.</p>
      <p class="foot reveal" style="--i:3">Internal strategy&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;August 2026</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hint"><span>scroll</span><span class="arrow">↓</span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- 1b · BOOST vs ADS MANAGER -->
  <section class="slide slide--light" id="s1b">
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">How we advertise</p>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="--i:1">Boosting vs. a real campaign</h2>
      <p class="sub reveal" style="--i:2">Same money behind Facebook — built for two very different jobs.</p>
      <div class="cmp reveal" style="--i:3">
        <div class="hcell blank"></div>
        <div class="hcell h-boost"><div class="lab">BOOST</div><div class="tag">The "Promote" button — what we run now</div></div>
        <div class="hcell h-ads"><div class="lab">ADS MANAGER</div><div class="tag">The full platform — what we should run</div></div>

        <div class="dim">Meta optimizes for</div>
        <div class="cell boost">Loose reach &amp; engagement</div>
        <div class="cell ads">The exact action — leads, calls, or sales</div>

        <div class="dim">Lead capture</div>
        <div class="cell boost">None — a call that can go unanswered</div>
        <div class="cell ads">Instant Form → name + phone straight into GHL</div>

        <div class="dim">Audiences</div>
        <div class="cell boost">Basic age &amp; interest picks</div>
        <div class="cell ads">Custom + lookalikes (our Cherry list) + retargeting</div>

        <div class="dim">Testing</div>
        <div class="cell boost">One post, one shot</div>
        <div class="cell ads">A/B test angles; the winner takes the budget</div>

        <div class="dim">What we can measure</div>
        <div class="cell boost">Clicks &amp; calls only</div>
        <div class="cell ads">Cost per sale, all the way down the funnel</div>

        <div class="dim">Cost Efficiency</div>
        <div class="cell boost">Cheap clicks & engagement, but high cost-per-sale</div>
        <div class="cell ads">Same minimum spend, but optimized for cheaper sales & higher ROI</div>
      </div>
      <div class="strip reveal" style="--i:4"><b>Bottom line:</b> <span>Our boosted post already proves the demand — cheap clicks, real calls. Ads Manager takes the same creative, finds better-matched people, stops losing callers, and finally shows cost per sale.</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 · DIAGNOSIS -->
  <section class="slide slide--light" id="s2">
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">The diagnosis</p>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="--i:1">We don't have a traffic problem</h2>
      <p class="lede reveal" style="--i:2">Our paid ads already produce Cherry financing applications — so the demand is real. <b>What holds back sales is price and trust, not awareness.</b></p>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="card card--diag reveal" style="--i:3">
          <span class="ic ic--navy"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.59 13.41 13.42 20.58a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0L2 12V2h10l8.59 8.59a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.82z"/><line x1="7" y1="7" x2="7.01" y2="7"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Price is the first hurdle</h3>
          <p>A prescription pair runs $2,000–$7,000. That number is what every new lead sees first.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card card--diag reveal" style="--i:4">
          <span class="ic ic--cherry"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Trust is the real barrier</h3>
          <p>People are buying a medical device sight-unseen, fully remote. They need reasons to believe.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card card--diag reveal" style="--i:5">
          <span class="ic ic--navy"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H8a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/><path d="M2 20h20"/><path d="M14 12v.01"/></svg></span>
          <h3>No cheap entry point now</h3>
          <p>With OTC discontinued, there's no low-cost product to ease people in. Financing must do that job.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="foot reveal" style="--i:6">The fastest dollar is raising revenue per lead we already have — before spending on more leads.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 · APPROACH -->
  <section class="slide slide--light" id="s3">
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">The approach</p>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="--i:1">Fix the leaks before widening the top</h2>
      <p class="sub reveal" style="--i:2">Raise conversion first, then feed it high-intent traffic. A lean team wins by running a few things excellently.</p>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="phase reveal" style="--i:3">
          <div class="phase-card phase-card--hot">
            <div class="num">1</div>
            <div class="when">This week</div>
            <h3>Convert what we already pay for</h3>
            <p>Lift revenue per lead with three moves inside GHL.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="phase reveal" style="--i:4">
          <div class="phase-card">
            <div class="num">2</div>
            <div class="when">This month</div>
